# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# The reason is concrete: spec/check-spec.pl and the CI job verify that the
# committed example byte-matches what example/make-example.pl writes. Without
# this, the same correct script produces a diff on Windows and no diff on
# Linux, and the check becomes noise instead of a signal.
* text=auto eol=lf
